 adjudicó el 17 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 17 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 44 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.950 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que muchos contratos estén cerca del límite no indica que se hayan excedido. Puede deberse a precios de mercado o a necesidades específicas.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en años distintos. Analizar si los contratos de diciembre reflejan una tendencia estacional.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 53 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 6.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 8.0, with a 95% confidence interval of 5.1 to 12.8. December accounts for 17% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 17% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 5. Contract [1], for 14,950 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar proportions exist in other contracts. The number of contracts awarded to a single provider does not prove misconduct, as multiple contracts can serve different needs.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and values of contracts awarded in December to see if they align with other contracts. Review the services provided by awardee A to determine if multiple contracts served the same purpose. Examine if the contracts were awarded to the same provider for similar services across different years.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["Tbt%2FiOYG61js%2BnLj3vAg5A%3D%3D","bZ0b%2FX%2FGSZTmnwcj%2BxbdTg%3D%3D","%2BHwrh%2BnHcC6OUi78BmzhOQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}